{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dog boarded a train and drifted into endless dreams\u2014strange, whimsical, and full of mysteries. Among fleeting visions, a figure once appeared and vanished. Now every dream feels like a search: will it lead to reunion, or only deeper into the maze of dreams?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Wake Up My Dream</strong> is a lighthearted puzzle-adventure full of <strong>nonsensical humor</strong>, cozy vibes, and the joy of discovery. You\u2019ll dive into the dog\u2019s dreamscape, <strong>exploring freely, triggering unexpected events, and collecting dream fragments</strong>. Each dream pops in a different style\u2014sometimes sweet, sometimes absurd\u2014and the fun lies in uncovering the surprises each dream holds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free exploration drives the story</strong>: Uncover quirky events that make you smile, gently steer the dream\u2019s direction, and enjoy the delight of discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky events &amp; multiple endings</strong>: Your choices shape each ending\u2014from healing warmth to unpredictable, hilarious twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed, varied gameplay</strong>: Light puzzles, interactive triggers, mini-games, and narrative choices\u2014fun, easygoing, and often laugh-out-loud silly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect dream fragments</strong>: Each fragment reveals part of the story, encouraging exploration and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art</strong>: Cozy, expressive visuals that draw you into a whimsical dream world full of charm.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736300?t=1760774676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736300?t=1760774676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/7be8330ea85d00f765fd462f16dba0d7514a41a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760774676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/7be8330ea85d00f765fd462f16dba0d7514a41a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760774676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3742020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dog boarded a train and drifted into endless dreams\u2014strange, whimsical, and full of mysteries. Among fleeting visions, a figure once appeared and vanished. Now every dream feels like a search: will it lead to reunion, or only deeper into the maze of dreams?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Wake Up My Dream</strong> is a lighthearted puzzle-adventure full of <strong>nonsensical humor</strong>, cozy vibes, and the joy of discovery. You\u2019ll dive into the dog\u2019s dreamscape, <strong>exploring freely, triggering unexpected events, and collecting dream fragments</strong>. Each dream pops in a different style\u2014sometimes sweet, sometimes absurd\u2014and the fun lies in uncovering the surprises each dream holds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free exploration drives the story</strong>: Uncover quirky events that make you smile, gently steer the dream\u2019s direction, and enjoy the delight of discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky events &amp; multiple endings</strong>: Your choices shape each ending\u2014from healing warmth to unpredictable, hilarious twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed, varied gameplay</strong>: Light puzzles, interactive triggers, mini-games, and narrative choices\